<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sol Villagra — Diseño de Interiores</title>
<meta name="description" content="Portfolio de Sol Villagra, estudiante de Diseño de Interiores en la Universidad de Palermo, Buenos Aires.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;1,300;1,400&family=Jost:wght@200;300;400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --w:#FAF8F3;--c:#F2EDE3;--b1:#E2D9CC;--b2:#C4B9A8;
  --b3:#9E9388;--s1:#72706A;--s2:#3E3B36;--k:#1C1914;
  --sage:#6B7B69;--sage2:#9AAF98;
  --serif:'Cormorant Garamond',Georgia,serif;
  --sans:'Jost',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --ease:cubic-bezier(.25,.46,.45,.94);
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{font-size:16px;scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--sans);background:var(--w);color:var(--s2);font-weight:300;line-height:1.7;overflow-x:hidden;min-width:1080px}
*{cursor:none}
#cur{position:fixed;width:8px;height:8px;background:var(--k);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);transition:width .35s var(--ease),height .35s var(--ease)}
#cur.big{width:46px;height:46px;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--k)}
nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:600;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:2rem 5vw;transition:background .5s}
nav.scrolled{background:rgba(250,248,243,.93);backdrop-filter:blur(14px)}
.logo{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--k);text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem}
.logo-rule{width:1px;height:16px;background:var(--b2)}
.logo-sub{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--b3);font-weight:300}
.nav-links{list-style:none;display:flex;gap:3.5rem}
.nav-links a{font-size:.64rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--b3);text-decoration:none;font-weight:300;transition:color .3s}
.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.on{color:var(--k)}
#home{width:100vw;height:100vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:54% 46%}
.h-left{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(148deg,#DDD3BF 0%,#C9BAA4 45%,#B3A48E 100%)}
.h-geo{position:absolute;inset:0}
.h-geo::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:14%;left:20%;width:1px;height:52%;background:rgba(250,248,243,.2)}
.h-geo::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:40%;left:20%;width:38%;height:1px;background:rgba(250,248,243,.14)}
.h-rect{position:absolute;bottom:18%;right:14%;width:20%;aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid rgba(250,248,243,.16)}
.h-rect2{position:absolute;top:18%;right:20%;width:28%;aspect-ratio:2/3;border:1px solid rgba(250,248,243,.09)}
.h-big-letter{position:absolute;bottom:4%;left:6%;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:11rem;font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:rgba(250,248,243,.07);line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.04em;user-select:none}
.h-scroll{position:absolute;bottom:2.8rem;right:2.8rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp 1s var(--ease) 2s forwards}
.h-scroll span{font-size:.52rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(250,248,243,.45);writing-mode:vertical-rl}
.h-track{width:1px;height:60px;background:rgba(250,248,243,.18);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.h-track::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:-100%;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;background:rgba(250,248,243,.55);animation:trackDown 2.3s ease-in-out infinite 2.2s}
.h-right{background:var(--w);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:9rem 5.5vw 5.5rem 4.5vw;position:relative}
.h-right::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:50%;left:0;width:1px;height:18%;background:var(--b1);transform:translateY(-50%)}
.h-eyebrow{font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:2rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s var(--ease) .4s forwards}
.h-name{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(4rem,5.8vw,5.8rem);font-weight:300;line-height:.93;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--k);margin-bottom:.25rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .9s var(--ease) .6s forwards}
.h-name-it{font-style:italic;color:var(--b3)}
.h-discipline{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.1rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--b3);margin-bottom:3.5rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .9s var(--ease) .8s forwards}
.h-statement{font-size:.83rem;color:var(--s1);max-width:37ch;line-height:2.05;border-left:1px solid var(--b1);padding-left:1.4rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .9s var(--ease) 1s forwards}
.h-btns{margin-top:3.5rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2.2rem;opacity:0;animation:fadeUp .8s var(--ease) 1.2s forwards}
.lnk{font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--k);text-decoration:none;border-bottom:1px solid var(--k);padding-bottom:.22rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;transition:color .35s,border-color .35s}
.lnk svg{transition:transform .3s}
.lnk:hover{color:var(--sage);border-color:var(--sage)}
.lnk:hover svg{transform:translateX(5px)}
.lnk.ghost{color:var(--b3);border-color:var(--b2)}
.lnk.ghost:hover{color:var(--s2);border-color:var(--b3)}
.sec-tag{font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.1rem;margin-bottom:3rem}
.sec-tag::after{content:'';width:32px;height:1px;background:var(--sage)}
.sec-h{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,3.2vw,3rem);font-weight:300;line-height:1.1;color:var(--k)}
.sec-h em{font-style:italic;color:var(--b3)}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px);transition:opacity .9s var(--ease),transform .9s var(--ease)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.d1{transition-delay:.1s}.d2{transition-delay:.22s}.d3{transition-delay:.34s}
#sobre{min-height:100vh;display:grid;grid-template-columns:44% 56%;background:var(--w)}
.sobre-vis{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(155deg,#CEC1AD 0%,#B8A890 50%,#A09280 100%);min-height:600px}
.sobre-frame1{position:absolute;top:10%;left:8%;right:28%;bottom:28%;border:1px solid rgba(250,248,243,.18)}
.sobre-frame2{position:absolute;top:28%;left:28%;right:8%;bottom:8%;border:1px solid rgba(250,248,243,.09)}
.sobre-letter{position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:14rem;font-style:italic;color:rgba(250,248,243,.06);font-weight:300;user-select:none}
.sobre-badge{position:absolute;bottom:0;right:0;background:var(--k);color:var(--w);padding:1.1rem 1.6rem;font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1.8}
.sobre-body{padding:8rem 5.5vw 6rem 4.5vw;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
.sobre-p{font-size:.86rem;color:var(--s1);line-height:2.1;max-width:50ch;margin-bottom:1.5rem}
.sobre-p strong{font-weight:400;color:var(--s2)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:2rem 0 3rem}
.chip{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--b3);border:1px solid var(--b2);padding:.4rem .85rem;transition:border-color .3s,color .3s}
.chip:hover{border-color:var(--sage);color:var(--sage)}
#proyectos{background:var(--c);padding:8rem 5vw}
.proy-top{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:end;margin-bottom:5rem}
.proy-desc{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--s1);line-height:2;max-width:44ch}
.pcard-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr .6fr;gap:1.1rem;margin-bottom:1.1rem}
.pcard{position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:block;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.pcard-cover{width:100%;display:block;aspect-ratio:16/10;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .9s var(--ease)}
.pcard:hover .pcard-cover{transform:scale(1.04)}
.pcard:hover img{transform:scale(1.04)}
.pcard-veil{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgba(28,25,20,.7) 0%,transparent 55%);opacity:0;transition:opacity .5s;pointer-events:none}
.pcard:hover .pcard-veil{opacity:1}
.pcard-cta{position:absolute;bottom:1.6rem;left:1.8rem;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:.92rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--w);opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);transition:opacity .4s,transform .4s;pointer-events:none}
.pcard:hover .pcard-cta{opacity:1;transform:none}
.pcard-info{padding:1.1rem 0 .3rem}
.pcard-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.85rem;margin-bottom:.4rem}
.pcard-cat{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage)}
.pcard-yr{font-size:.58rem;color:var(--b3)}
.pcard-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.28rem;font-weight:400;line-height:1.15;color:var(--k);margin-bottom:.28rem}
.pcard-concept{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--s1);font-style:italic}
.pcard-right{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.1rem}
.pcard-future{flex:1;background:var(--b1);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:1rem;opacity:.4}
.pcard-row2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.1rem}
.pcard-ph{background:var(--b1);min-height:160px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:1rem;opacity:.35}
.proy-note{margin-top:3.5rem;padding:1.8rem 2.2rem;border:1px solid var(--b1);display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:1.2rem}
.proy-note-icon{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.8rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--b2);flex-shrink:0;line-height:1;margin-top:.1rem}
.proy-note-text{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--s1);line-height:1.9}
.proy-note-text strong{font-weight:400;color:var(--s2)}
#cv{background:var(--w);padding:8rem 5vw}
.cv-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:5rem;margin-top:4.5rem}
.cv-col-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--k);margin-bottom:2rem;padding-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1)}
.cv-entry{margin-bottom:1.8rem}
.cv-yr{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:.26rem}
.cv-ttl{font-size:.84rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--s2);margin-bottom:.16rem}
.cv-org{font-size:.74rem;color:var(--b3);line-height:1.7}
.sw-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.38rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem}
.sw-chip{font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--b3);border:1px solid var(--b1);padding:.4rem .65rem;text-align:center;transition:border-color .3s,color .3s}
.sw-chip:hover{border-color:var(--sage);color:var(--sage)}
.lang-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1);padding-bottom:1rem}
.lang-name{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--s2)}
.lang-level{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--b3);font-style:italic}
#contacto{background:var(--k);padding:9rem 5vw 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
#contacto::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-35%;right:-10%;width:55%;height:80%;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(107,123,105,.06);filter:blur(90px);pointer-events:none}
.ct-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9rem;position:relative}
.ct-h{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,3.8vw,3.6rem);font-weight:300;line-height:1.06;color:var(--w);margin-bottom:1.4rem}
.ct-h em{font-style:italic;color:var(--b3)}
.ct-p{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--b3);line-height:2;max-width:40ch;margin-bottom:3rem}
.ct-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem}
.ct-link{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.1rem;color:rgba(250,248,243,.7);text-decoration:none;font-size:.78rem;transition:color .3s}
.ct-link:hover{color:var(--w)}
.ct-link:hover .ct-icon{border-color:var(--sage2)}
.ct-icon{width:33px;height:33px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.13);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;transition:border-color .3s}
.ct-icon svg{width:13px;height:13px;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.5}
.ct-field{margin-bottom:1.9rem}
.ct-lbl{display:block;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--b3);margin-bottom:.6rem}
.ct-inp,.ct-ta{width:100%;background:transparent;border:none;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);color:var(--w);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.86rem;font-weight:300;padding:.5rem 0;outline:none;transition:border-color .3s}
.ct-inp:focus,.ct-ta:focus{border-color:rgba(154,175,152,.65)}
.ct-inp::placeholder,.ct-ta::placeholder{color:rgba(255,255,255,.18)}
.ct-ta{resize:none;height:68px;line-height:1.7}
.ct-btn{margin-top:.5rem;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.62rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--w);background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);padding:1rem 2.2rem;transition:background .4s,border-color .4s}
.ct-btn:hover{background:var(--sage);border-color:var(--sage)}
.footer{margin-top:6rem;padding:2rem 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.footer-n{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:.88rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.25)}
.footer-c{font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.1em;color:rgba(255,255,255,.15)}
/* FICHA */
.ov{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(28,25,20,.95);z-index:800;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .4s;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);overflow-y:auto;padding:5vh 5vw}
.ov.on{opacity:1;pointer-events:all}
.ficha{background:var(--w);width:100%;max-width:1060px;margin:auto;position:relative;transform:translateY(20px) scale(.98);transition:transform .45s var(--ease)}
.ov.on .ficha{transform:none}
.ficha-close{position:fixed;top:2rem;right:3rem;background:none;border:none;font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(250,248,243,.55);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-family:var(--sans);z-index:820;transition:color .3s}
.ficha-close:hover{color:var(--w)}
.ficha-hero img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.ficha-body{padding:3.5rem 4.5rem 5rem}
.ficha-header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:4rem;padding-bottom:3.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1);margin-bottom:4rem}
.ficha-eyebrow{font-size:.54rem;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--sage);margin-bottom:.9rem}
.ficha-title{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(2.6rem,3.5vw,3.6rem);font-weight:300;line-height:.95;color:var(--k);margin-bottom:.4rem}
.ficha-subtitle{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:.96rem;font-style:italic;color:var(--b3);margin-bottom:2rem}
.ficha-specs{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2rem}
.fsp-item .fsp-label{font-size:.5rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--b3);margin-bottom:.18rem}
.fsp-item .fsp-val{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--s2)}
.ficha-lema{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:var(--k);line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1.4rem}
.ficha-desc{font-size:.83rem;color:var(--s1);line-height:2.1;max-width:50ch}
.fsec{margin-bottom:4rem}
.fsec-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.8rem}
.fsec-label{font-size:.54rem;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--b3)}
.fsec-rule{flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--b1)}
.fitem{margin-bottom:1.2rem}
.fitem-label{font-size:.52rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--b3);margin-bottom:.55rem}
.fitem img{width:100%;display:block;border:1px solid var(--b1)}
.fg2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.2rem}
@keyframes fadeUp{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)}100%{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@keyframes trackDown{0%{top:-100%}100%{top:100%}}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:2px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:var(--w)}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--b2)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="cur"></div>

<nav id="nav">
  <a href="#home" class="logo">Sol Villagra<span class="logo-rule"></span><span class="logo-sub">Diseño de Interiores</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#sobre">Sobre mí</a></li>
    <li><a href="#proyectos">Proyectos</a></li>
    <li><a href="#cv">CV</a></li>
    <li><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<section id="home">
  <div class="h-left">
    <div class="h-geo"></div><div class="h-rect"></div><div class="h-rect2"></div>
    <span class="h-big-letter">SV</span>
    <div class="h-scroll"><div class="h-track"></div><span>scroll</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="h-right">
    <p class="h-eyebrow">Buenos Aires · Universidad de Palermo</p>
    <h1 class="h-name">Sol<br><span class="h-name-it">Villagra</span></h1>
    <p class="h-discipline">Diseño de Interiores</p>
    <p class="h-statement">Cada proyecto parte de una idea que define la experiencia del espacio. El detalle y la coherencia entre concepto y resultado final son mi compromiso.</p>
    <div class="h-btns">
      <a href="#proyectos" class="lnk">Ver proyectos <svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><line x1="0" y1="4" x2="12" y2="4"/><polyline points="8,1 12,4 8,7"/></svg></a>
      <a href="#contacto" class="lnk ghost">Contacto</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="sobre">
  <div class="sobre-vis">
    <div class="sobre-frame1"></div><div class="sobre-frame2"></div>
    <div class="sobre-letter">SV</div>
    <div class="sobre-badge">Sol Villagra<br>UP · Buenos Aires</div>
  </div>
  <div class="sobre-body">
    <p class="sec-tag reveal">Sobre mí</p>
    <h2 class="sec-h reveal d1">Concepto primero,<br><em>espacio después</em></h2><br>
    <p class="sobre-p reveal d2">Soy estudiante de <strong>Diseño de Interiores en la Universidad de Palermo</strong>, actualmente en el segundo año. Mi proceso creativo parte siempre desde una idea conceptual: primero entender qué experiencia debe generar el espacio, después tomar cada decisión de diseño en función de eso.</p>
    <p class="sobre-p reveal d2">Me formé en el <strong>Colegio Mark Twain</strong> con orientación en lenguas (IGCSE Cambridge · IB), lo que me dio una mirada analítica y bilingüe. Trabajo con fluidez en herramientas de modelado y renderizado, y me comprometo con la <strong>coherencia entre concepto y resultado final</strong>.</p>
    <div class="chips reveal d3">
      <span class="chip">Diseño conceptual</span><span class="chip">Modelado 3D</span><span class="chip">Renderizado</span>
      <span class="chip">Diseño comercial</span><span class="chip">Comunicación visual</span><span class="chip">Bilingüe</span>
    </div>
    <a href="data:application/pdf;base64," download="CV_SolVillagra.pdf" class="lnk reveal d3">Descargar CV <svg width="15" height="8" viewBox="0 0 15 8" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><line x1="0" y1="4" x2="12" y2="4"/><polyline points="8,1 12,4 8,7"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="proyectos">
  <div class="proy-top">
    <div class="reveal"><p class="sec-tag">Proyectos</p><h2 class="sec-h">Trabajo<br><em>académico</em></h2></div>
    <p class="proy-desc reveal d2">Proyectos desarrollados en la Universidad de Palermo. Cada uno parte de un concepto que define la experiencia del espacio y se traduce en planimetría, vistas, cortes y render final.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="pcard-grid reveal">
    <!-- Paqué & Cocö -->
    <div class="pcard" onclick="openFicha()">
      <img class="pcard-cover" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Paqué Cocö fachada">
      <div class="pcard-veil"></div>
      <span class="pcard-cta">Ver ficha →</span>
      <div class="pcard-info">
        <div class="pcard-meta"><span class="pcard-cat">Local Comercial</span><span class="pcard-yr">2026</span></div>
        <h3 class="pcard-title">Paqué &amp; Cocö</h3>
        <p class="pcard-concept">"Despertando los sentidos."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
